title: "Can Open LLMs Diagnose Cloud-Native Failures? A Ground-Truth Benchmark from Injected Faults"
abstract: "A ground-truth benchmark of 26 injected Kubernetes failures with known root causes, evidence bundles, and a deterministic grading rubric, evaluated against five open LLMs."
